Open Writer derives its editor, analysis engine, document handling, UI,
contracts, evaluation corpus, and tests from Abstract Writer's online-writer
project, copied at the project owner's direction on 2026-10-26.
The browser writing prompts are adapted from its Rust provider prompts.

